{
  "name": "card",
  "title": "卡片",
  "titleEn": "Card",
  "category": "data",
  "summary": "纸白底、手绘圆角的内容容器，可加缝线、胶带，或做成整卡可点击的入口。",
  "when": "承载一组相关内容（文章摘要、功能入口、个人资料）。只需要一行信息时用 list；需要大号统计数字时用 stat。",
  "root": "riko-card",
  "element": "article / a（可点击时）",
  "parts": [
    {
      "class": "riko-card__media",
      "desc": "顶部（或横排时左侧）图片区，会贴边"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__header",
      "desc": "顶部一行：图标 + 标签"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__icon",
      "desc": "倾斜的方块图标"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__tag",
      "desc": "让标签靠右的包裹类（可直接加在 riko-tag 上）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__title",
      "desc": "标题（标题字体）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__sub",
      "desc": "标题下的手写副标"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__body",
      "desc": "正文，自动撑开剩余高度"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__content",
      "desc": "横排卡片中的文字列"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__footer",
      "desc": "底部操作区（虚线分隔）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__cta",
      "desc": "视觉上的「按钮」，仅用于可点击整卡内部"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card__actions",
      "desc": "__header 右侧的操作区（下拉菜单、图标按钮）"
    }
  ],
  "modifiers": [
    {
      "class": "riko-card--stitched",
      "desc": "缝线内框",
      "group": "decor"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--taped",
      "desc": "顶部胶带（会自动留出上边距）",
      "group": "behavior"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--interactive",
      "desc": "整卡可点击：悬停上浮微旋、右下角色团放大",
      "group": "behavior"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--feature",
      "desc": "首页大入口卡：更大内边距、图标与标题",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--compact",
      "desc": "紧凑",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--soft",
      "desc": "米色底",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--ice",
      "desc": "冰蓝底",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--accent",
      "desc": "浅橙底",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--flat",
      "desc": "去阴影",
      "group": "decor"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--horizontal",
      "desc": "图文横排（窄屏自动变竖排）",
      "group": "layout"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-card--lg",
      "desc": "大内边距（阅读纸张、文章正文）",
      "group": "size"
    }
  ],
  "js": null,
  "a11y": [
    "整卡可点击时整张卡就是一个链接：用 <a class=\"riko-card riko-card--interactive\" href>，卡片内部不要再放其他链接或按钮。",
    "__icon 中的图标是装饰，Lucide 图标会自动 aria-hidden。"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "普通卡片里的操作放在 __footer，用 riko-btn。",
    "可点击卡片里的「开始阅读」用 <span class=\"riko-card__cta\">，它只是视觉提示。",
    "多张卡片用 riko-grid 排列，高度会自动对齐。",
    "标签放在 __header 里，加 riko-card__tag 即可靠右。",
    "头像/人物卡：把 riko-avatar 放在 __header 里（与 __tag 同行），名字写在 __title。",
    "底部一组标签：<div class=\"riko-card__footer\"><div class=\"riko-cluster riko-cluster--sm\">…riko-tag…</div></div>。",
    "--stitched 与 --taped 可以同时使用（像贴着胶带的手作纸张）。"
  ],
  "avoid": [
    "不要在 riko-card--interactive（<a>）里嵌套 <a> 或 <button>。",
    "不要自己写阴影/圆角覆盖，改用 --flat / tone 修饰。"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "基础卡片",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-grid\">\n  <article class=\"riko-card\">\n    <div class=\"riko-card__header\">\n      <span class=\"riko-card__icon\"><i data-lucide=\"palette\"></i></span>\n      <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--ice riko-card__tag\">设定</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">络可的画板</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">沙滩上的第一幅画，画的是碧空、大海和一只跃出水面的海豚。</p>\n    <div class=\"riko-card__footer\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"riko-btn riko-btn--sm riko-btn--soft\">查看设定</button>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"riko-card riko-card--stitched\">\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">星星酥</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__sub\">today's special</p>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">HV 甜品店的招牌点心，酥脆香甜，今天还是特价哦。</p>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"riko-card riko-card--taped\">\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">今日便签</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">记得给 Star 哥哥带一份星星酥，再去钓鱼场看看。</p>\n  </article>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "可点击的大入口卡",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-grid riko-grid--cols-2\">\n  <a class=\"riko-card riko-card--feature riko-card--interactive riko-card--stitched\" href=\"#card\">\n    <div class=\"riko-card__header\">\n      <span class=\"riko-card__icon\"><i data-lucide=\"book-open\"></i></span>\n      <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--accent riko-card__tag\"><span class=\"riko-star\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>敬请期待后续更新！</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">《络的世界》</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">从沙滩上的第一幅画开始，跟随主角一同踏入这个世界的边缘与深处。</p>\n    <span class=\"riko-card__cta\">开始阅读</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"riko-card riko-card--feature riko-card--interactive riko-card--stitched\" href=\"#card\">\n    <div class=\"riko-card__header\">\n      <span class=\"riko-card__icon\"><i data-lucide=\"notebook-pen\"></i></span>\n      <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--ice riko-tag--dashed riko-card__tag\">设定集 · 未完成</span>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">络可的笔记本</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">小说中已出现设定的整理与解释。建议先阅读已更新章节后再翻阅，避免剧透。</p>\n    <span class=\"riko-card__cta\">翻阅笔记本</span>\n  </a>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "带图片与横排",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-stack riko-stack--lg\">\n  <article class=\"riko-card\" style=\"max-width: 320px\">\n    <div class=\"riko-card__media\"><img src=\"https://riko.land/assets/logo.jpg\" alt=\"《络的世界》封面\"></div>\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">络的世界</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">一个关于画笔、星星与归途的故事。</p>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"riko-card riko-card--horizontal\">\n    <div class=\"riko-card__media\"><img src=\"https://riko.land/assets/logo.jpg\" alt=\"《络的世界》封面\"></div>\n    <div class=\"riko-card__content\">\n      <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">第一章 · 第五幕</h3>\n      <p class=\"riko-card__sub\">落星摇曳，清风回荡</p>\n      <p class=\"riko-card__body\">风过围垣，落星回响。少年脖颈上的流星项链轻轻摇曳，像一颗真正的落星。</p>\n      <div class=\"riko-card__footer\">\n        <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--sm\">17 节</span>\n        <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--sm riko-tag--accent\">最新</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "色调与紧凑",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-grid\" style=\"--riko-grid-min: 200px\">\n  <article class=\"riko-card riko-card--soft riko-card--compact\">\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">米色</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">像旧纸张一样温柔。</p>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"riko-card riko-card--ice riko-card--compact\">\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">冰蓝</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">边界之地的蓝色屏障。</p>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"riko-card riko-card--accent riko-card--compact\">\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">暖橙</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">贝雷帽上的小星星。</p>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"riko-card riko-card--flat riko-card--compact\">\n    <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">无阴影</h3>\n    <p class=\"riko-card__body\">适合嵌在其他容器里。</p>\n  </article>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "人物卡（头像 + 标签组）",
      "html": "<article class=\"riko-card riko-card--stitched\">\n  <div class=\"riko-card__header\">\n    <span class=\"riko-avatar riko-avatar--ring\"><img src=\"https://riko.land/assets/logo.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span>\n    <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--accent riko-card__tag\">主角</span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 class=\"riko-card__title\">络可</h3>\n  <p class=\"riko-card__sub\">little painter</p>\n  <p class=\"riko-card__body\">喜欢画画的小女孩，戴着带星星的贝雷帽。</p>\n  <div class=\"riko-card__footer\">\n    <div class=\"riko-cluster riko-cluster--sm\">\n      <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--sm\">画家</span>\n      <span class=\"riko-tag riko-tag--sm riko-tag--ice\">HV 村</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>"
    }
  ],
  "requires": [
    {
      "selector": ".riko-card--interactive:not(button)",
      "attr": "href",
      "message": "可点击整卡请用 <a href> 或 <button>"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-card__cta",
      "parent": ".riko-card--interactive",
      "message": "riko-card__cta 只用于 riko-card--interactive 内部；普通卡片的操作请用 riko-btn"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-card__title,.riko-card__body,.riko-card__header,.riko-card__footer,.riko-card__media",
      "parent": ".riko-card",
      "message": "card 的部件必须位于 riko-card 之内"
    }
  ],
  "related": [
    "list",
    "stat",
    "tag",
    "polaroid"
  ]
}